      "notes": "original/renamed paired, no chance correction; provider local vLLM v0.30.0 served by @logic on bariton (#13276), one RTX PRO 6000, BF16, --max-model-len 8192; No thinking mode; temperature 0, seeds 0/1/2. SmolLM2's chat template has no tool support, so it runs with our template: the card's own function-calling prompt and its <tool_call>[\u2026] call list, read by our vLLM parser (closed tags only). The card shows no way to return a tool result; we send results as <tool_response> turns, and after one the model often repeats the result instead of answering in a sentence. The runner rejected 40 Standard trials for combining state-changing calls in one step; the calls parsed successfully. Context 8,192 tokens, output cap 2,048; every prompt fit, so nothing is unscored. Card quickstart sampling (temperature 0.2, top_p 0.9), seed 0 only: 40.5% standard vs 39.3% at temperature 0 seed 0; harder 0% both.",
